{"articleNo":"497098","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=497098&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [엘리스 x 한국과학창의재단] 2024년 청소년 SW 동행 프로젝트 대학생 멘토 모집 (2차)","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.08.27","hit":"5480","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQDkgFAngRQOIA8BaBXA9gZQDEAVAeQFEARAYwEMAjbfegOgAcA7AcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">O 모집 개요</span><br></p><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;noto sans kr&quot;, &quot;noto sans cjk kr&quot;, &quot;noto sans cjk&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;apple sd gothic neo&quot;, &quot;nanum gothic&quot;, &quot;malgun gothic&quot;, dotum, arial, helvetica, Meiryo, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(1) 모집 대상 : SW/AI 분야 청소년 멘토링에 관심있는 대학생 (전공 무관, SW/AI 분야 전공자, 교육학 및 사범대학 소속 우대)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(2) 모집 기간 : 2024.08.23~2024.09.06</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(3) 신청절차 : 서류 접수 및 역량테스트 응시 (선발 인원에 한하여 오리엔테이션 실시 예정)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">O 활동 내용</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(1) 활동 장소 : 전국 소재 중/고등학교 (거주자 인근 지역으로 학교 배정)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(2) 활동 기간 : 2024.9~2024.11 (학교 동아리 매칭 후 세부 일정 협의)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(3) 활동 내용 : 전국 중/고등학교 SW/AI 동아리 대상 교육 멘토 및 진로 멘토 활동(온오프라인 병행)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 교육 멘토 : SW/AI 교육 중 발생하는 청소년들의 학습 질의사항 대응 (교육을 진행하는 주 강사는 따로 있음)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 진로 멘토 : 청소년 대상 입시준비 가이드, 대학생활 가이드, 전공 소개 등 (약 1시간 분량)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(4) 혜택</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 우수 멘토 대상 과학기술정보통신부 장관상 수여</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 봉사시간 지급을 원하는 분 : 봉사시간 및 실비(교통비, 식대 등) 지급</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 봉사시간 지급을 원하지 않는 분 : 활동비(시간 당 25,000원) 지급</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 고성능 GPU 이용권 2개월 지급 (NVIDIA A100 MIG 10/20gb)</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 멘토링 수료증 발급</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">O 문의</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">- 오픈카톡방 :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://event.stibee.com/v2/click/MzIxMzU1LzIzNTgyNTQvMTE3Lw/aHR0cHM6Ly9vcGVuLmtha2FvLmNvbS9vL2dXSlZXM0Nn\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"></a><a href=\"https://event.stibee.com/v2/click/MzIxMzU1LzIzNTgyNTQvMTE3Lw/aHR0cHM6Ly9vcGVuLmtha2FvLmNvbS9vL2dJR1JldUtn\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style